{"title": "Vecna", "pageid": 54938, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Vecna", "categories": ["Mentioned characters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Vecna</b> is referenced, but does not appear in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mentions\">Mentions</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Suspension_of_Nothic_Eye\" title=\"Suspension of Nothic Eye\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Suspension_of_Nothic_Eye_Item_Icon.png/30px-Suspension_of_Nothic_Eye_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Suspension_of_Nothic_Eye_Item_Icon.png/45px-Suspension_of_Nothic_Eye_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Suspension_of_Nothic_Eye_Item_Icon.png/60px-Suspension_of_Nothic_Eye_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Suspension_of_Nothic_Eye_Item_Icon.png/30px-Suspension_of_Nothic_Eye_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Suspension_of_Nothic_Eye_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Suspension_of_Nothic_Eye\" title=\"Suspension of Nothic Eye\">Suspension of Nothic Eye</a></span> - In tooltip</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Absolute_End\" title=\"The Absolute End\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/